=== 2.2  The repo's own precedent for the harness ===

  tests/cloud-code-ui.spec.ts:6
    " * Every backend call is intercepted with page.route, so this runs green against"
    " * no AWS."
  ...and 10 further page.route() calls in that one spec.

  So network-level interception with page.route() is the established in-repo way to
  render a hub UI with no AWS. Item 15 follows it rather than inventing a mechanism.

